  "deviations": [
    "The case bar's subtitle: the board shows a case description; the API has none, the page shows the case type and due date (artboardCss).",
    "The board draws no hint under 'Delete now'; the page says when it is available (artboardCss adds it to the board), and disables it with a reason once a report was served or deletion is paused.",
    "Gap: the certificate's 'Records: 1,231 pages and all copies' needs a page count the close summary does not carry; the page says 'the whole bundle and all copies'.",
    "Text the board sets at 15px is 17px (hints, certificate lines, scheduled line); body text stays at 17px or more.",
    "The Pause deletion button keeps a 52px hit area (the board draws 50px)."
  ]
